corner rows (2,7)/(2,8)/(2,9), all exact.] Updates: shift3 needs B₁
mod π^{N−v(s)} ⊆ mod π^{N−k−1} and B₂
mod π^{N−2v(s)} ⊆ mod π^{N−2k−2} to determine B₀′ mod π^N; B₂ mod
π^{N−2k−1} to determine B₁′ mod π^{N−k}; B₂′ = B₂ + 3s preserves the
