f(π^k(y+s̃))= π^{3k}·f̃(y+s̃) makes recentering commute with σ_k
(s = π^k s̃); and v(B₀) ≥ N ⟺ v(B̃₀) ≥ N−3k (exact division).
Hence **drain(X) ⟺ drain_{N−3k}(σ_k(X))**, and with (i): the D_k
